# VetBuddy Benefit Vault research ledger, federal 02 (deals, tickets, travel, scholarships, survivors, jobs, health)
# Format: CAT|TITLE|GROUPS|RULE|ELIGIBLE|VALUE|URL  (see data/research/RESEARCH_LOG.md)
# Commercial offers come from the vendor's own page (tier 3) and change often. Rows from tier 1 or 3 pages import as SOURCE_CHECKED, the rest as UNVERIFIED; none is VERIFIED until a named reviewer checks it (G1).

